  "title": "First Internet Bank to Speak at Nacha Smarter Faster Payments 2026 Conference",
  "summary": "First Internet Bank today announced that Anne Sharkey, Senior Vice President and Chief Risk Officer, will speak at the Nacha Smarter Faster Payments 2026 Conference in San Diego. Ms. Sharkey will participate in the spotlight session, “A Collaborative Vision of Customer Experience for the Future,” taking place Tuesday, April 28, from 4:10 PM – 5:00...",
